# Memory Loop — Every Chat

## Startup (before any edit or response)

1. Read `{{VAULT_DIR}}/02-PROJECTS/session-continuity.md`
2. Read `{{VAULT_DIR}}/02-PROJECTS/project-context.md`
3. Read `{{VAULT_DIR}}/02-PROJECTS/active-goals.md`
4. Read `{{VAULT_DIR}}/03-ERRORS/error-memory.md`
5. Read `{{VAULT_DIR}}/03-ERRORS/anti-patterns.md`
6. Read latest 1–3 digests from `{{VAULT_DIR}}/01-SESSIONS/`

**Red flags** — stop work if:
- Request matches a known error in error-memory
- Last digest says tests failing
- Request contradicts open decision

## Shutdown (after every meaningful session)

Follow `.cursor/MEMORY-WORKFLOW.md`:
1. Digest → `01-SESSIONS/YYYY-MM-DD/session-HHMM-cursor.md`
2. Overwrite `session-continuity.md`
3. Update error/decisions/goals as applicable
4. Code commit (source only): `feat/fix/refactor:`
5. Memory commit (vault only): `memory: YYYY-MM-DD cursor —`
6. `git push origin HEAD`
7. Reply with `## Memory` block

Full rules: `AGENTS.md`
